    {
      "block_id": "2605.25334_p6_b37",
      "text": "Figure 4: Composition of the MTS Dataset. (a) Distribution of Samples across Spatial Task Types;\n(b) Proportion of samples contributed by each source dataset; (c) Proportion of samples across three\nvisual modalities (single image, multiple images, and video).\n",
      "bbox": [
        107.67,
        194.82,
